WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:05.900
A sample board asks a customer to imagine the rest of the room.

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:09.390
Most of them cannot, so the sale waits.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:13.400
They scan a code and photograph the room on their own phone.

00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:17.690
No app, no sign-in. It lands in your account.

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:20.620
Your catalogue is the palette.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:28.150
Import the brand's own PDF: 101 materials, with their sizes and finishes.

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:33.430
Tap a surface, pick a tile. Looking is free.

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:35.460
Add the wall, then render it properly.

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:43.710
The sample is warped onto each surface's own plane and only re-lit, so the pattern and its repeat are exact.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:47.580
Where the first tile starts decides the whole job.

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:53.600
37 tiles, 13% wastage, 12 slivers along the wall.

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:58.750
The tidy start costs ₹1,300 more, and prints a cut list.

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:01.480
Send it out under your own name.

00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:05.540
Before, after, and a decision.

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.260
Hayfield.
